WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.590
Here is how JobCairn gets you ready for

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.853
the interview.

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:08.368
Learn turns the gaps across your saved jobs

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.847
into short study guides,

00:00:09.887 --> 00:00:11.679
with diagrams and tips.

00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:15.705
Each interview gets practice questions written

00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:16.937
for that job.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.190
Claude can also make short videos:

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.740
a walkthrough of the ad,

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.068
a lesson, or a practice pitch.

00:00:25.703 --> 00:00:26.508
JobCairn.

00:00:26.548 --> 00:00:28.403
Walk in prepared.

